## Features of This Template

1. **Filename Variable Substitution** — Any directory or file named `__variable__` gets replaced with the variable value
2. **Tera Rendering** — Files ending in `.template` are rendered with Jinja2/Tera syntax
3. **Non-Template Files** — Files without `.template` suffix are copied verbatim (like `.gitignore`)
4. **Post-Processing** — After generation, literal placeholders (like `__COPYRIGHT_YEAR__`) can be replaced
5. **Preserve Sections** — Mark sections with begin/end markers to keep user edits through regenerations
6. **File Exclusion** — Use glob patterns to exclude files from the output
7. **Git Hooks** — The pre-commit hook runs `python -m py_compile` on Python files to catch syntax errors

Learn more at: https://github.com/anthropics/templator
